Just to let you know that the schedule is now online for the Tracing
Summit 2013 at http://tracingsummit.org/wiki/TracingSummit2013

This event is co-located with LinuxCon Europe 2013 at Edinburgh, on
October 23rd. If you want to attend, you will need to be registered to
LinuxCon or CloudOpen. Please note that registration fees for these
events increase after September 19th. See
https://events.linuxfoundation.org/events/linuxcon-europe/attend/register
for details.

